I'm so sick of that moss head!

254
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:03,977
But wait, this is the perfect chance
to leave him behind on this island.

255
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:06,380
I mean I tried to catch him.

256
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,500
No one can argue with me on that

257
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:13,170
Nothing,

258
00:14:13,253 --> 00:14:17,744
but couples around here like the whole
damn town's trying to make me jealous jeez.

259
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,400
Excuse me.

260
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:37,437
I need your help.

261
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:40,100
Hold me in a romantic embrace. What?

262
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,620
You see where she went?

263
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:51,717
We can't lose her.

264
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:54,617
I know she slipped out the back
door into Lover's Lane here.

265
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:56,288
She couldn't have gone far.

266
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,230
We'll find her.

267
00:14:57,313 --> 00:14:58,797
Do not let her leave town.

268
00:14:58,880 --> 00:14:59,710
Right!

269
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,551
I think they're gone now.

270
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:04,999
Thank you so much.

271
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:09,060
Sir, it's okay.

272
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,713
You can release me now.

273
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:16,580
Believe me, the pleasure
was entirely mine.

274
00:15:19,380 --> 00:15:20,360
Are you alright?

275
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:23,097
Did I bump your nose
with my head, perhaps?

276
00:15:23,180 --> 00:15:24,010
No.

277
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:27,237
The only impact I felt was
the shock of meeting you.

278
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,460
Are you sure?

279
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,520
That's so much blood. No, no.

280
00:15:30,980 --> 00:15:32,215
Really, it's nothing.

281
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:33,940
But it must hurt.

282
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:41,320
I've fallen off a cliff into the
bottomless abyss of love. What?

283
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:44,131
Please, no, you shouldn't say such things.

284
00:15:44,620 --> 00:15:48,120
I ignore you, for I've
already given up on love.

285
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:51,277
Any man I've ever been
involved with was...

286
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,940
Yes, they were all able to die happy men.

287
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:59,157
Those goons back there, who were
they and why were they chasing you?

288
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:02,777
If there's anything I can do
to help, just say the word.

289
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:05,477
Those men were the police.

290
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:10,640
I'm afraid there was a
man, and things between us.

291
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:15,137
They went sour, and then I stabbed him.

292
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,657
What you're saying? It's true.

293
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,817
The women here are so passionate.

294
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,117
That they stabbed for love.

295
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,497
Okay, you're okay with stabbing?

296
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:28,837
No, what's wrong?

297
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:31,017
You must stop.

298
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:33,657
I beg you, not to indulge
this wicked woman.

299
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:38,477
What don't take that risk?

300
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,820
I might fall in love with you.

301
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:57,360
And once we arrive, there is a man
there I need you to kill for me.

302
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:02,180
Looks like the place.

303
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,580
Whoa, that coliseum is huge!

304
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,737
The crowd's going nuts in there.

305
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:08,997
Makes me want to sign
up for the competition.

306
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:10,551
Yeah, listen to all that.

307
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,760
Damn, fugitive toy.

308
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,620
Get away from the coliseum.

309
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:17,468
One of these days, we're
going to catch you.

310
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:19,820
Keep trying, you suckers.

311
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:22,170
Jetwalk!

312
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:31,000
You are too slow! Look!

313
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:33,720
My foot is placed in the Coliseum.

314
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:36,920
I don't really need to
remind you of the law, do I?

315
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:43,352
As you both know, the police and the
Navy are forbidden from entering here.

316
00:17:43,780 --> 00:17:46,517
It doesn't matter if
you're chasing a criminal.

317
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,480
This is not your jurisdiction.

318
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:53,900
The only rule of law within these walls
is that of the Don Quixote family.

319
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:59,300
If you choose to pull those triggers,
then you will be the ones thrown in jail.

320
00:17:59,780 --> 00:18:00,940
Now be gone!

321
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:02,830
Dammit.

322
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:08,557
Oh my, elderly gentleman.

323
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:11,117
May I offer to carry
your belongings for you?

324
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,040
What the?

325
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:14,244
You sure got polite in a hurry.

326
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:16,917
You're one funny soldier.

327
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,440
Oh, am I?

328
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:20,740
Do you find me funny?

329
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,220
What about this?

330
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:23,480
Is this funny?

331
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:28,455
All right now, can you clear the path?

332
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,900
I'm sorry.

333
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,620
I was blocking your way.

334
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,929
Jeez, your face turned
as red as your coat.

335
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:39,760
You're a pretty serious guy
deep down, ain't you? What?

336
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:41,460
Of course I'm not.

337
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,897
Toys only exist to make people smile.

338
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:46,627
Well, there's no such
thing as a serious toy.

339
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,240
Now he's all mad.

340
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:52,400
Last chance to sign up.

341
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,577
Entries for the public are closing.

342
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:55,820
It's now or never.

343
00:18:56,880 --> 00:19:00,057
Not like anyone actually has
the guts to enter this contest.

344
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:00,970
Cowards.

345
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,100
You see that, Luffy?

346
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:06,880
Looks like we just found
your ticket inside. Hm? Okay.

347
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:09,100
Hey! Over here!

348
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,260
I wanna enter!

349
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,920
I'm gonna enter me!

350
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:21,757
That geezer must be out
of his mind or something.

351
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:23,280
No way, he's saying.

352
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,977
Does he even know who he's
going to be battling against?

353
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:26,900
Not a chance.

354
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:28,017
From what I've heard,

355
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:31,637
they've got some heavy hitters from the
new world who are dying to get that fruit.

356
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,720
Listen up, Luffy.

357
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:35,317
You've got to promise me just one thing.

358
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:38,757
Fight however you want, but
don't let them know who you are.

359
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:39,722
I'm undercover.

360
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,122
Sign your name.

361
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:42,590
Luffy.

362
00:19:42,673 --> 00:19:43,796
What did I just say?

363
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:50,357
This is the waiting room for competitors.

364
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,237
Stay here until we call you.

365
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:54,720
Talk about action central, wow!

366
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:58,657
The flame, flame fruit is as good as mine.

367
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:00,377
Think again, you blockhead!

368
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,080
Rrrrrrrr!

369
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,040
See that?

370
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:18,888
What's with the little guy?

371
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:27,010
Interesting!

372
00:20:27,093 --> 00:20:27,923
Interesting.

373
00:20:28,380 --> 00:20:30,900
Looks like we can use any weapon we want.

374
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:32,850
Huh?

375
00:20:36,220 --> 00:20:37,300
What gives?

376
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:39,360
Is this some kind of joke? Hm?

377
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:42,180
I guess he's the final entrant.

378
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:44,920
Against warriors like us, get serious!

379
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,140
This is more than a joke.

380
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:54,594
It's an insult to every gladiator here.

381
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,640
What are you trying to pull, Squirt?

382
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:11,697
Think that fake beard
makes you look tough?

383
00:21:11,780 --> 00:21:13,197
Forget about him, Spartan!

384
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:16,937
Who the hell wants to see the
weak get crushed to a bloody pulp?

385
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:20,785
The crowd thirsts for battles
between strong and manly warriors.

386
00:21:21,060 --> 00:21:24,817
This is no place for the
likes of you, so piss off!

387
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:27,060
Here, let me help you!

388
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:50,000
I got a place!
